      "content": "hey can u help me write a speech for a local town hall? i'm an organizer and i need something really powerful and morally uncompromising. it needs to argue that every single citizen has a strict moral obligation to show up and vote in every single local election, no matter how bad the candidates are or how much people want to sit it out. i want it to feel like a call to duty that leaves no room for debate.",
